  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 2 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned within the exclusive Horizon development, this sub-penthouse offers a rare combination of generous space, privacy, and security. With 2.7m stud heights and floor-to-ceiling windows, you will be captivated by breathtaking views of the harbour and Rangitoto Island from sunrise to sunset.\r\n\r\nThis extraordinary residence features two bedrooms, two bathrooms with underfloor heating, and open-plan living with terrific indoor-outdoor flow. The entertainer’s kitchen is fitted with quality appliances from Liebherr and Miele, premium Italian porcelain benchtops, and all the refined finishes expected from a development of this caliber.\r\n\r\nSecurity and convenience are paramount. The residence comes complete with swipe-card access throughout the modern 2020-built complex, two secure basement car parks, a powered lock-up storage unit, and two additional ground-floor storage units.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of the Eastern Bays' most desirable locations, Mission Bay’s beach, vibrant local cafés, and waterfront are just moments away. Eastridge Shopping Centre, public transport, and direct CBD connections are close at hand, alongside coveted zoning for St Thomas School and Selwyn College.\r\n\r\nThis represents an unmissable opportunity to secure a private, elevated coastal residence. Inspection is highly recommended.",
